IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `rra-types`
IMPORT `rra-tenancy`
IMPORT `rra-bidding`
IMPORT `rra-goal`

-- Renters' Rights Act 2025 (UK) — the encoder's tests. Expected values are
-- worked by hand from the Act.

§ `Tests`

-- Fields: assured, fixed term, periods differ, rent periods, before
-- commencement, excepted, entered into, first day.
GIVEN k IS A `Rent period kind`
GIVETH A `Tenancy terms`
`a 2026 assured tenancy paid` k MEANS
    `Tenancy terms` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, k, FALSE, FALSE, Date 20 1 2026, Date 1 2 2026

monthlyTenancy MEANS `a 2026 assured tenancy paid` `monthly`

GIVEN start IS A DATE, finish IS A DATE, due IS A DATE, regular IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `Rent period`
`a rent period from` start `to` finish `, due` due `, regular day` regular MEANS
    `Rent period` OF start, finish, due, regular

§§ `Goal 1 — periodic tenancies and rent periods`

#ASSERT `fixed-term or period terms are of no effect in` (`Tenancy terms` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, `monthly`, FALSE, FALSE, Date 20 1 2026, Date 1 2 2026)
#ASSERT `fixed-term or period terms are of no effect in` (`Tenancy terms` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, `monthly`, FALSE, FALSE, Date 20 1 2026, Date 1 2 2026)
#ASSERT NOT (`fixed-term or period terms are of no effect in` monthlyTenancy)
#ASSERT NOT (`fixed-term or period terms are of no effect in` (`Tenancy terms` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, `monthly`, FALSE, FALSE, Date 20 1 2026, Date 1 2 2026))
#ASSERT `the rent periods are permitted in` monthlyTenancy
#ASSERT `the rent periods are permitted in` (`a 2026 assured tenancy paid` (`periods of days` 28))
#ASSERT NOT (`the rent periods are permitted in` (`a 2026 assured tenancy paid` (`periods of days` 29)))
#ASSERT NOT (`the rent periods are permitted in` (`a 2026 assured tenancy paid` `longer periods, such as quarterly or yearly`))

§§ `Goal 2 — rent in advance`

-- First month, due 25 January in the permitted pre-tenancy period (20-31
-- January): initial rent, allowed.
#ASSERT NOT (`the term for rent due in advance is of no effect for` monthlyTenancy `in` (`a rent period from` (Date 1 2 2026) `to` (Date 28 2 2026) `, due` (Date 25 1 2026) `, regular day` (JUST (Date 1 2 2026))))
#ASSERT `the day the rent is due for` monthlyTenancy `in` (`a rent period from` (Date 1 2 2026) `to` (Date 28 2 2026) `, due` (Date 25 1 2026) `, regular day` (JUST (Date 1 2 2026))) EQUALS Date 25 1 2026
-- Due 15 January, before the tenancy was entered into: of no effect; due on
-- the regular rent day, 1 February.
#ASSERT `the day the rent is due for` monthlyTenancy `in` (`a rent period from` (Date 1 2 2026) `to` (Date 28 2 2026) `, due` (Date 15 1 2026) `, regular day` (JUST (Date 1 2 2026))) EQUALS Date 1 2 2026
-- Second month, due 25 February: not initial rent (the 28 days end
-- 28 February; this period ends 31 March) — of no effect.
#ASSERT `the term for rent due in advance is of no effect for` monthlyTenancy `in` (`a rent period from` (Date 1 3 2026) `to` (Date 31 3 2026) `, due` (Date 25 2 2026) `, regular day` (JUST (Date 1 3 2026)))
#ASSERT `the day the rent is due for` monthlyTenancy `in` (`a rent period from` (Date 1 3 2026) `to` (Date 31 3 2026) `, due` (Date 25 2 2026) `, regular day` NOTHING) EQUALS Date 1 3 2026
#ASSERT `the day the rent is due for` monthlyTenancy `in` (`a rent period from` (Date 1 3 2026) `to` (Date 31 3 2026) `, due` (Date 25 2 2026) `, regular day` (JUST (Date 15 3 2026))) EQUALS Date 15 3 2026
-- Weekly: the period 22-28 February ends within the initial 28 days, so it
-- is initial rent; paid in the pre-tenancy period, allowed.
weekly MEANS `a 2026 assured tenancy paid` (`periods of days` 7)
#ASSERT NOT (`the term for rent due in advance is of no effect for` weekly `in` (`a rent period from` (Date 22 2 2026) `to` (Date 28 2 2026) `, due` (Date 25 1 2026) `, regular day` NOTHING))
#ASSERT `the term for rent due in advance is of no effect for` weekly `in` (`a rent period from` (Date 1 3 2026) `to` (Date 7 3 2026) `, due` (Date 25 1 2026) `, regular day` NOTHING)
-- Due on the first day of the period: not in advance.
#ASSERT NOT (`the term for rent due in advance is of no effect for` monthlyTenancy `in` (`a rent period from` (Date 1 3 2026) `to` (Date 31 3 2026) `, due` (Date 1 3 2026) `, regular day` NOTHING))
-- Excepted and pre-commencement tenancies.
#ASSERT NOT (`the term for rent due in advance is of no effect for` (`Tenancy terms` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, `monthly`, FALSE, TRUE, Date 20 1 2026, Date 1 2 2026) `in` (`a rent period from` (Date 1 3 2026) `to` (Date 31 3 2026) `, due` (Date 25 2 2026) `, regular day` NOTHING))
#ASSERT NOT (`the term for rent due in advance is of no effect for` (`Tenancy terms` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, `monthly`, TRUE, FALSE, Date 20 1 2026, Date 1 2 2026) `in` (`a rent period from` (Date 1 3 2026) `to` (Date 31 3 2026) `, due` (Date 25 2 2026) `, regular day` NOTHING))
-- TFA Sch 1 para 1(1A).
#ASSERT `a payment of rent on` (Date 19 1 2026) `is prohibited for` monthlyTenancy
#ASSERT NOT (`a payment of rent on` (Date 20 1 2026) `is prohibited for` monthlyTenancy)

§§ `Goal 3 — rental bidding`

-- Fields: relevant tenancy, written ad, sign only, rent stated, above
-- stated rent, authority satisfied.
#ASSERT `a rental bidding penalty may be imposed for` (`Letting conduct` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`a rental bidding penalty may be imposed for` (`Letting conduct` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`a rental bidding penalty may be imposed for` (`Letting conduct` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE))
#ASSERT `a rental bidding penalty may be imposed for` (`Letting conduct` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`a rental bidding penalty may be imposed for` (`Letting conduct` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`a rental bidding penalty may be imposed for` (`Letting conduct` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE))
#ASSERT `the maximum rental bidding penalty` EQUALS 7000
-- s 57(2): new penalty 1 March 2027; the five years run 2 March 2022 to
-- 1 March 2027.
#ASSERT `an additional penalty may be imposed on` (Date 1 3 2027) `after` (`Earlier penalty` OF Date 2 3 2022, TRUE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`an additional penalty may be imposed on` (Date 1 3 2027) `after` (`Earlier penalty` OF Date 1 3 2022, TRUE, FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`an additional penalty may be imposed on` (Date 1 3 2027) `after` (`Earlier penalty` OF Date 2 3 2022, FALSE, FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`an additional penalty may be imposed on` (Date 1 3 2027) `after` (`Earlier penalty` OF Date 2 3 2022, TRUE, TRUE))

§§ `The top-level goal`

pos MEANS `the renting position for` (`Renting case` OF monthlyTenancy, JUST (`a rent period from` (Date 1 3 2026) `to` (Date 31 3 2026) `, due` (Date 25 2 2026) `, regular day` (JUST (Date 1 3 2026))), NOTHING)
#ASSERT pos's `runs as a periodic tenancy`
#ASSERT pos's `rent periods permitted`
#ASSERT pos's `advance-rent term of no effect` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT pos's `rent due on` EQUALS JUST (Date 1 3 2026)
#ASSERT pos's `rental bidding penalty may be imposed` EQUALS NOTHING
